sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength for Drosophila persimilis at 2.1 µm — MorphoEval overall 86.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 re-run. Pearson r = 0.9993, RMSE = 0.033 µm, ablation ratio = 0.051, measured wavelengths 1.955 / 2.097 / 2.807 µm for paulistorum / persimilis / planitibia. Orientation KS between the gallery plate and the activator is 0.505, so the plate match and the stripe model are not the same claim. Age 0 Ma, scale 2.098e-06 m. No electron micrograph was found. Overall 86.8/100 (faithfulness 85.4, reproducibility 90.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 6c49ecbdcc1e6d2fcf72d168ee46196263be7d3b; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 78, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_persimilis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 6c49ecbdcc1e6d2fcf72d168ee46196263be7d3b, image/png, 306753 B, 1440×960 px, artifact_sha256 dedf562e5c821cfda99a468d5b61d22be7bdf2ffbf87a1a4b3f9ad686681793a (sha256 dedf562e5c821cfda99a468d5b61d22be7bdf2ffbf87a1a4b3f9ad686681793a), spec_fingerprint 6cfd22b3b1eb8b085833af27f643b5e89f6fcf635888d87c45635473a8295900. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 6cfd22b3b1eb8b085833af27f643b5e89f6fcf635888d87c45635473a8295900; artifact_sha256: dedf562e5c821cfda99a468d5b61d22be7bdf2ffbf87a1a4b3f9ad686681793a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_persimilis_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_persimilis_specimen.jpg=f1216712eddebdcd..., datasets/drosophila_persimilis_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_persimilis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=a12c3e1298940f01..., datasets/drosophila_persimilis_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=9eb570b42e0a0ddc...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Noor et al. 2001: chromosomal inversions contribute to reproductive isolation between D. pseudoobscura and D. persimilis. | Dobzhansky & Spassky 1959: D. paulistorum is a cluster of incipient species. | Kambysellis et al. 1995: Hawaiian Drosophila diversified by ecological shifts; D. planitibia is the picture-wing successor in this chronoseries. | Turing 1952 and Schnakenberg 1979: differential diffusion selects a finite critical wavelength. | Ready, Hanson & Benzer 1976: the retinal lattice motivates a period near 2 µm.; reconstructed_in_script: Onset wavenumber tuned so λ(D. persimilis) = 2.098 µm at r = 20, a = 0.10, b = 0.90. | λ(paulistorum) = 1.947 µm and λ(planitibia) = 2.735 µm from L^0.42, then integrated. Centroids 1.955 µm and 2.807 µm. | Du sweep Pearson r = 0.9993, RMSE = 0.033 µm. Ablation ratio = 0.051. Five-seed SD near 0. β endpoints 0.20 and 0.70 keep the predecessor shorter than the successor.; transfer_boundary: 2.098 µm is the assigned detail-tier wavelength (log10 = -5.678), not a numeral in the inversion paper. | Body lengths 2.36, 2.82 and 5.30 mm are catalog adult sizes. β = 0.42 is not fitted to a measured pigment series. | The GIF terminal frame is the gallery plate used by the image-fitness crop. It is not the Schnakenberg field.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the gallery spiral is ocellar pigment at 2.1 µm. | Does not claim noise alone selects k_c in 1200 steps. | Does not reuse the 117 µm slot 2891 parameter table (alpha_scale 1.33).." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Mitigated, not closed. KS = 0.505 separates the gallery plate from the activator. An electron or light micrograph of D. persimilis pigment at 2.1 µm is still missing; Commons had no CC bitmap.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Addressed as a sensitivity, not as an empirical fit. Integrated β endpoints keep the predecessor shorter than the successor. β = 0.42 is still a transfer from catalog body lengths.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Addressed for the imposed-seed concern. Ablation ratio 0.051 is in the measurement set. A long noise-seeded run that selects k_c without a cosine initial condition is still not shown.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.868"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, pass 2 after re-run)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

